# Line endings are LF in the repository and LF in the working tree, on every
# host. This overrides core.autocrlf, which is `true` on the primary Windows
# development host and would otherwise check every file out with CRLF.
#
# This is not a style preference. A shell script checked out with CRLF fails
# inside a Linux container with a bad-interpreter error that names neither the
# script nor the line endings, and this project ships a container with an
# entrypoint script.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
